For the first time Telecinco will duplicate the value of its rival Antena 3.
"We've done it."
Paolo Vasile, Telecinco’s enacting adviser at Telecinco, expressed his satisfaction with the closing of the market yesterday, when it turned out that the TV station led by him doubled the value of his rival Antena 3.
“It only hurts that it’s not because we’ve risen more, it’s because we’ve fallen less,” he said.
